      "sourceTextSha256": "d58570b9fdd1c60ff1a1779c5cf92d49a67081d664a13002c38cd338f8125632",
      "text": "Day 4 · After breakfast, transfer to the airport in time for your flight to Foz do Iguaçu, where you are welcomed and taken to your hotel. In the afternoon, visit the magnificent Iguaçu Falls: following the walkways along the canyon of the Iguazu River, you pass hundreds of small waterfalls, arriving in front of the huge Devil’s Throat, the most powerful of all, with the splashing water and rainbows all around you. At the end of the tour, your guide drops you off at your hotel.",
